<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Agent Details - Killjoy</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">VALORANT PROTOCOL</a>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="details.html">Details</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="about.html">About</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="new-character-form.html">Add a Character</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                <img src="images/killjoy.jfif" class="img-fluid rounded shadow border border-secondary" alt="Killjoy">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold" style="color: #ff4655;">KILLJOY</h1>
                <span class="badge badge-sentinel fs-6 mb-3">Sentinel</span>
                
                <ul class="list-unstyled mt-3 text-light">
                    <li><strong>Real Name:</strong> Klara Böhringer</li>
                    <li><strong>Origin:</strong> Germany</li>
                    <li><strong>First Appearance:</strong> Valorant (2020)</li>
                    <li><strong>Signature Ability:</strong> Turret</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-4 border-bottom pb-2 text-white">Abilities</h3>
                <ul class="text-light">
                    <li><strong>Nanoswarm (C):</strong> Throw a covert grenade that deploys damaging nanobots.</li>
                    <li><strong>Alarmbot (Q):</strong> Deploy a bot that hunts down enemies and leaves them vulnerable.</li>
                    <li><strong>Turret (E):</strong> Deploy a turret that automatically fires at enemies in a 180-degree cone.</li>
                    <li><strong>Lockdown (X):</strong> Deploy a device that detains all enemies caught in its radius.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-4 border-bottom pb-2 text-white">Backstory</h3>
                <p class="text-light">The genius of Germany, Killjoy secures the battlefield with ease using her arsenal of inventions. If the damage from her gear doesn't stop her enemies, her robots' debuffs will finish the job.</p>

                <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-outline-light mt-3">Back to Gallery</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>